       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. READ-STUDENTS.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT STUDENT-FILE ASSIGN TO "STUDENTS.DAT"
               ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS-CODE.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD STUDENT-FILE.
       01 STUDENT-RECORD.
          05 STUDENT-ID PIC 9(4).
          05 STUDENT-NAME PIC X(15).
          05 STUDENT-MARKS PIC 999.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 FILE-STATUS-CODE PIC XX.
       01 END-FLAG PIC X VALUE "N".
       01 RECORD-COUNT PIC 99 VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           OPEN INPUT STUDENT-FILE.
           IF FILE-STATUS-CODE NOT = "00"
               DISPLAY "COULD NOT OPEN STUDENTS.DAT"
               STOP RUN
           END-IF.
           PERFORM READ-NEXT-RECORD.
           PERFORM UNTIL END-FLAG = "Y"
               DISPLAY STUDENT-ID " " STUDENT-NAME " "
                       STUDENT-MARKS
               ADD 1 TO RECORD-COUNT
               PERFORM READ-NEXT-RECORD
           END-PERFORM.
           CLOSE STUDENT-FILE.
           DISPLAY "RECORDS READ: " RECORD-COUNT.
           STOP RUN.
       READ-NEXT-RECORD.
           READ STUDENT-FILE
               AT END MOVE "Y" TO END-FLAG
           END-READ.
